The curb this scene walks over, and the clip it tracks, are curb_000's geometry and its
take 000 from NVIDIA's GRAIL dataset
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/PhysicalAI-Robotics-Locomanipulation-GRAIL, at
40e7957), whose card states:

    "Use of the released dataset is governed by the Creative Commons Attribution-
     NonCommercial 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0)."

and that its procedurally generated curbs, slopes and stairs are "GRAIL-original outputs,
released under CC BY-NC 4.0." ORCS stages both as its own tile and clip. The license's
terms are at

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

It permits sharing and adapting for noncommercial purposes only, with credit.
